[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 113 Small change Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 0.69,
    "end": 11.052,
    "zh": "第113课 零钱 听录音,然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "第113課 零錢 聽錄音,然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Who has got some small change?",
    "start": 11.956,
    "end": 15.258,
    "zh": "谁有零钱？",
    "zh_hant": "誰有零錢？"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Fares, please!",
    "start": 17.279,
    "end": 18.88,
    "zh": "请买票！",
    "zh_hant": "請買票！"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Trafalgar Square, please.",
    "start": 19.0,
    "end": 21.401,
    "zh": "请到特拉法加广场。",
    "zh_hant": "請到特拉法加廣場。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "I'm sorry, sir.",
    "start": 21.741,
    "end": 23.422,
    "zh": "对不起，先生。",
    "zh_hant": "對不起，先生。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "I can't change a ten-pound note.",
    "start": 24.263,
    "end": 27.864,
    "zh": "我找不开十英镑的钞票。",
    "zh_hant": "我找不開十英鎊的鈔票。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "Haven't you got any small change?",
    "start": 28.084,
    "end": 31.626,
    "zh": "您没有零钱吗？",
    "zh_hant": "您沒有零錢嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "I've got no small change, I am afraid.",
    "start": 32.067,
    "end": 35.768,
    "zh": "恐怕我没有零钱。",
    "zh_hant": "恐怕我沒有零錢。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "I'll ask some of the passengers.",
    "start": 36.649,
    "end": 39.29,
    "zh": "我去问问其他乘客。",
    "zh_hant": "我去問問其他乘客。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "Have you any small change, sir?",
    "start": 40.14,
    "end": 43.321,
    "zh": "先生，您有零钱吗？",
    "zh_hant": "先生，您有零錢嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "I'm sorry.",
    "start": 43.701,
    "end": 44.881,
    "zh": "对不起。",
    "zh_hant": "對不起。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "I've got none.",
    "start": 44.921,
    "end": 46.522,
    "zh": "我没有。",
    "zh_hant": "我沒有。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "I haven't got any either.",
    "start": 48.162,
    "end": 50.623,
    "zh": "我也没有。",
    "zh_hant": "我也沒有。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "Can you change this ten-pound note, madam?",
    "start": 51.703,
    "end": 55.984,
    "zh": "夫人，您能换开这张十英镑的钞票吗？",
    "zh_hant": "夫人，您能換開這張十英鎊的鈔票嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "I'm afraid I can't.",
    "start": 56.904,
    "end": 59.525,
    "zh": "恐怕我不能。",
    "zh_hant": "恐怕我不能。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Neither can I. I'm",
    "start": 60.165,
    "end": 63.726,
    "zh": "我也不能。",
    "zh_hant": "我也不能。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "very sorry, sir.",
    "start": 63.376,
    "end": 65.106,
    "zh": "非常抱歉，先生。",
    "zh_hant": "非常抱歉，先生。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "You must get off the bus.",
    "start": 65.266,
    "end": 68.027,
    "zh": "您必须下车。",
    "zh_hant": "您必須下車。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "None of our passengers",
    "start": 68.587,
    "end": 71.148,
    "zh": "我们所有的乘客",
    "zh_hant": "我們所有的乘客"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "can change this note.",
    "start": 70.808,
    "end": 73.188,
    "zh": "都换不开这张钞票。",
    "zh_hant": "都換不開這張鈔票。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "They're all millionaires!",
    "start": 73.608,
    "end": 75.989,
    "zh": "他们都是百万富翁！",
    "zh_hant": "他們都是百萬富翁！"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "Except us.",
    "start": 76.429,
    "end": 78.329,
    "zh": "除了我们。",
    "zh_hant": "除了我們。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "I've got some small change.",
    "start": 79.51,
    "end": 82.099,
    "zh": "我有一些零钱。",
    "zh_hant": "我有一些零錢。"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "So have I.",
    "start": 82.965,
    "end": 84.549,
    "zh": "我也有。",
    "zh_hant": "我也有。"
  }
]
